  "@type": "SoftwareSourceCode",
  "identifier": "picard",
  "description": "It provides a unified interface to configure, trigger, and log multi-step ETL pipelines (T2–T5) used for clinical data harmonisation and analysis within the VAC4EU network and UMCU’s Digital Research Environment (DRE). The package enables:- Dynamic orchestration of project-specific transformation scripts, Configuration-driven control of pipeline substeps (T2–T5), Logging, auditing, plottinh and reproducibility tracking. PICARD is designed to “make it run”: ensuring consistent, transparent, and reproducible execution of UMCU’s data processing pipelines.",
  "name": "picard: PICARD is an internal R package designed to manage and coordinate the execution of modular R scripts across the UMC Utrecht data transformation pipeline",
